      "content": "I cannot give you a direct \"safe\" or \"unsafe\" answer because I am not a medical doctor. While you may not feel symptoms now, any drug interaction risk exists between haloperidol and pseudoephedrine. Given your concerns and the urgency, calling a pharmacist in a local pharmacy is often the quickest way to get advice tailored to your medication schedule. They can provide immediate, professional guidance on safe dosing.",
