    "summary": "The user is asking for confirmation on whether it is safe to take pseudoephedrine (Sudafed) while currently prescribed haloperidol for schizophrenia. The assistant repeatedly declines to provide medical clearance, explains the potential risks of the interaction, and directs the user to consult a healthcare professional or pharmacist.",
